  "description": {
   "en": "A collection of horror stories depicting casual fears that lurk around you.\nIn the midst of your everyday life, the entrance to fear and madness awaits you...!\n\nA tragedy caused by sisters who don't get along, a grandmother who decides to live alone because her house is small and is talking to her... These horrifying short stories will hit you before you can catch your breath! If you like horror, you can't go wrong reading this\n\nWritten by Noguchi Senri, who appeared in Junji Ito's Marronier!"
  },
